This repository uses:
- Nuxt 3
- TypeScript
- pnpm workspace
- Cloudflare Workers / D1 / R2

Follow these constraints:
- Do not invent infrastructure outside the stack above
- Do not switch framework
- Do not remove raw HTML persistence
- Do not bypass schemas
- Do not put direct SQL in route handlers when a repository/service layer exists
- Keep changes narrow and task-focused
- When uncertain, write docs and TODOs instead of making destructive assumptions
- Prefer explicit types
- Prefer zod validation for external/parsing boundaries
- Add tests when changing parser, crawler, or DB behavior